---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import BudgetTrail from '../components/BudgetTrail.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="Money, Step by Step" description="A practical system for planning, using, and growing household money.">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="page-shell home-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">A calm system for your money</p>
        <h1>Build a money system you can keep using.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Plan the money you have, keep the plan current, and decide what the next dollar should support.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#choose-start">Choose where to start <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/budget/">See the full system</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-illustration" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="wallet-card card-back"><span>Next priority</span><b>Ready</b></div>
        <div class="wallet-card card-front">
          <span>Budget</span><b>$0</b>
          <i></i><i></i><i></i>
        </div>
        <div class="coin coin-one">$</div>
        <div class="coin coin-two">$</div>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 230 120"><path d="M7 109C48 45 89 135 126 67s76-42 97-56"/><circle cx="223" cy="11" r="7"/></svg>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="page-shell"><BudgetTrail /></div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section page-shell" id="choose-start" aria-labelledby="choose-heading">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Choose your situation</p>
      <h2 id="choose-heading">Start with the part you need.</h2>
      <p>There is no single right entry point. Choose the next useful action for your household.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="situation-grid">
      <a class="situation-card tone-blue" href="/budget/">
        <span>01</span><h3>I need a budget.</h3><p>Set up accounts, plan categories, and give the money you have a job.</p><b>Build the first plan →</b>
      </a>
      <a class="situation-card tone-coral" href="/day-to-day/">
        <span>02</span><h3>I already have a budget.</h3><p>Process spending, fund categories, and keep the plan current.</p><b>Use the routine →</b>
      </a>
      <a class="situation-card tone-yellow" href="/money-priorities/">
        <span>03</span><h3>My budget is stable.</h3><p>Choose whether the next dollar should support safety, debt, retirement, or another goal.</p><b>Choose a priority →</b>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="system-section" aria-labelledby="system-heading">
    <div class="page-shell">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">One money system</p>
        <h2 id="system-heading">Direction and routine work together.</h2>
        <p>The financial path tells you what to fund next. The budget routine helps you carry that decision into everyday life.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="system-grid">
        <article class="system-card system-card-path"><span class="system-number">A</span><p class="eyebrow">Financial path</p><h3>Where should money go?</h3><p>Move from stability to a safety net, debt reduction, retirement, and goals that matter to you.</p><a class="text-link" href="/money-priorities/">Explore money priorities →</a></article>
        <article class="system-card system-card-routine"><span class="system-number">B</span><p class="eyebrow">Budget routine</p><h3>How will the plan work?</h3><p>Assign income, categorize spending, reconcile monthly, and adjust as real life changes.</p><a class="text-link" href="/budget/">Open the budget guide →</a></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="privacy-strip">
    <div class="page-shell privacy-inner">
      <span class="privacy-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
      <div><h2>Your numbers stay with you.</h2><p>This guide does not ask for account details or collect financial data. Checklist and guide progress stays in this browser.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
